cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Replication package for: Have Firms Become More Responsive to Returns? A Changing Capital-Adjustment Gradient in Japan"
abstract: >-
  Code and public input data for the estimation of investment gradients among
  Japanese listed firms, FY1999-2024.  The estimation sample itself is drawn
  from Nikkei NEEDS Financial QUEST and cannot be redistributed; a synthetic
  panel generator with known true coefficients is included so that the pipeline
  can be run and checked without a NEEDS licence.
type: software
authors:
